format 1
adapter chat 1
npc: npc-mina

node chat-mina-up-apron
kind: unprompted
pose: explain
trigger: lessons_completed:19
title: At the dentist

    I'm at the dentist.

    They've just put a heavy lead apron over me for an X-ray of my teeth.

sticker: nerd -> chat-mina-apron-nerd
sticker: star -> chat-mina-apron-star
sticker: radiation -> chat-mina-apron-rad

node chat-mina-apron-nerd
kind: reply
pose: proud

    I knew you'd have a name for it.

    Time, distance or shielding?

reply: shielding -> chat-mina-apron-shield
reply: distance -> chat-mina-apron-dist
reply: time -> chat-mina-apron-time

node chat-mina-apron-star
kind: reply
pose: greet

    Thank you. It's a good moment to practise.

    The apron is one of the three ways. Which one?

reply: shielding -> chat-mina-apron-shield
reply: distance -> chat-mina-apron-dist
reply: time -> chat-mina-apron-time

node chat-mina-apron-rad
kind: reply
pose: idle

    Yes, an X-ray is radiation. A short, controlled amount.

    The apron is one of the three ways to lower a dose. Which one?

reply: shielding -> chat-mina-apron-shield
reply: distance -> chat-mina-apron-dist
reply: time -> chat-mina-apron-time

node chat-mina-apron-shield
kind: reply
pose: proud

    Shielding. The apron is lead, and it sits between the X-ray and the rest of me.

    Dentists place a lead apron on patients having X-rays of their teeth.

react: clap -> chat-mina-apron-end
react: like -> chat-mina-apron-end

node chat-mina-apron-dist
kind: reply
pose: explain

    Not quite. I haven't moved, and the machine hasn't either. Distance is about stepping away from the source.

    A barrier in the way is a different one.

reply: oh, shielding -> chat-mina-apron-shield
reply: so which one? -> chat-mina-apron-shield

node chat-mina-apron-time
kind: reply
pose: explain

    Not quite. Less time lowers a dose, but the apron doesn't make the X-ray shorter.

    It's a barrier. That's the third way.

reply: shielding -> chat-mina-apron-shield
reply: oh, I see -> chat-mina-apron-shield

node chat-mina-apron-end
kind: sign_off
pose: greet

    The apron is on, the X-ray is done.

    Lead between me and the source. That's shielding.
